{
  "sheet": "vfx_events",
  "doc": "Moments of the kit and the League particle system each plays, by the skin's resource key (key = a name hashed like League does, or #hex for keys League ships unnamed); every skin maps the same keys to its own systems. attach: caster (follows him), bone:<joint> (his bone), target (the enemy hit), point (the cast point, turned to the cast), missile (follows the missile), beam (from his chest to the target), fly_to_caster (moves from the target to him). scale multiplies League units after Fiddlesticks' model scale. Events with no system in a skin fall back to the effects sheet. W's tether is not League's beam but the mod's own curved tendrils (effects sheet, creator's choice); the heal has no effect. No heal missiles either (League's W_Mis are little hands flying from the enemies to him; the creator found them odd).",
